    "title": "🧪 Group assignments — 25.0%|||🧪 Group assignments — 25.0%",
    "slug": "law102-flm-thi-3",
    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Group assignments 25.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LAW102 · Assessment 3/6</span>\n<h2>Group assignments</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13718 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LAW102 · Đầu điểm 3/6</span>\n<h2>Group assignments</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13718 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">25.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO3, CLO5, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Presentation; OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Guideline: on session 1 Moot court: are held respectively on session: 28,29,30,31 (moot court 1); 40,41,42,43 (moot court 2); 54,55,56,57 (moot court 3). 1. Cases for Moot court: U.S case, assigned by Lecturer. 2. Preparation: Costume and Equipments are taken at Administrative Department and preserved by Students till the last moot court. 3. Groups: 06. Two groups will represent for DEFENDANT and PLAINTIFF respectively to work together on 01 moot court with 01 case. Each group comprises of 4 students at least. 4. Language: English mainly. 5. Participants in 01 moot court: all lawyers in 2 moot court-groups, 01 chairman of JURIES and 03 JUDGES (elected by Lecturer in non-moot court groups). 6. Steps to hold a moot court: 6.1. Arrangement of court room, get ready on gowns. 6.2. Plaintiff and Defendant present FACT of the case (play, video, ppt) 6.3. Juries and Judges make questions regarding the FACT. 6.4. Plaintiff and defendant making a debate regarding ISSUES of the case. Judges can make questions to clear down the argument. 6.5. After debate, Juries make questions regarding all the ISSUES. 6.6. Decision of Judges and Juries: Juries votes for the winner with ballot. Judges decides the stronger group. Judges and Chairman of Juries give the comment for weakness and strength of both sides. 6.7. Results: decided by Voting of Juries and Decision of Judges. If they are opposite to each other. The Lecturer will decide. Further guidance, please refer to INDIVIDUAL AND ASSIGNMENT GUIDELINE attached to Course Implementation Plan Submit report: as requested by the lecturer for every moot court OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 28 — GROUP PRESENTATION 1 (Mootcourt 1)</li><li>Session 29 — GROUP PRESENTATION 1 (Mootcourt 1)</li><li>Session 30 — GROUP PRESENTATION 1 (Mootcourt 1)</li><li>Session 31 — GROUP PRESENTATION 1 (Mootcourt 1)</li><li>Session 40 — GROUP PRESENTATION 2 (Mootcourt 2)</li><li>Session 41 — GROUP PRESENTATION 2 (Mootcourt 2)</li><li>Session 42 — GROUP PRESENTATION 2 (Mootcourt 2)</li><li>Session 43 — GROUP PRESENTATION 2 (Mootcourt 2)</li><li>Session 54 — GROUP PRESENTATION 3 (Mootcourt 3)</li><li>Session 55 — GROUP PRESENTATION 3 (Mootcourt 3)</li><li>Session 56 — GROUP PRESENTATION 3 (Mootcourt 3)</li><li>Session 57 — GROUP PRESENTATION 3 (Mootcourt 3)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 28 — GROUP PRESENTATION 1 (Mootcourt 1)</li><li>Buổi 29 — GROUP PRESENTATION 1 (Mootcourt 1)</li><li>Buổi 30 — GROUP PRESENTATION 1 (Mootcourt 1)</li><li>Buổi 31 — GROUP PRESENTATION 1 (Mootcourt 1)</li><li>Buổi 40 — GROUP PRESENTATION 2 (Mootcourt 2)</li><li>Buổi 41 — GROUP PRESENTATION 2 (Mootcourt 2)</li><li>Buổi 42 — GROUP PRESENTATION 2 (Mootcourt 2)</li><li>Buổi 43 — GROUP PRESENTATION 2 (Mootcourt 2)</li><li>Buổi 54 — GROUP PRESENTATION 3 (Mootcourt 3)</li><li>Buổi 55 — GROUP PRESENTATION 3 (Mootcourt 3)</li><li>Buổi 56 — GROUP PRESENTATION 3 (Mootcourt 3)</li><li>Buổi 57 — GROUP PRESENTATION 3 (Mootcourt 3)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=LAW102\">Exam Room — LAW102</a> (4 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=LAW102\">Phòng thi — LAW102</a> (4 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
